OL,3,GNEWSAEvent held to celebrate Thai
OL,4,Aculture in Jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn event thought to be the first of its
OL,7,Fkind has been held in Jersey to
OL,8,Fcelebrate Thai culture in the island.
OL,10,FDozens of people came together at the
OL,11,FTown Hall in St Helier on Friday to
OL,12,Fenjoy Thai food and learn more about
OL,13,Fthe community's traditions.
OL,15,FOrganisers arranged for Buddhist monks
OL,16,Ffrom the UK to be part of the event
OL,17,Fwhere they spoke about the history of
OL,18,FThailand and helped lead those in
OL,19,Fattendance in a traditional chant.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
