OL,3,GNEWSAEvent held to celebrate Thai
OL,4,Aculture in Jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity representative Dararat
OL,7,FLorimer said it was the first time Thai
OL,8,Fand Jersey communities and celebrated
OL,9,Ftogether and the event aimed to "bring
OL,10,Ffuture generations together".
